==Event Information==
<!--Event Information based on reference, September 26th, 2022-->
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Time to celebrate 8 Years of The Battle Cats!!'''}}<br>
Whether you're a brand new player or have been supporting us since 2014, we thank you for enjoying our game!<br>
We couldn't have made it to 8 years without amazing and loyal players from all over the world!<br>
Lets kick off the real celebration with a spectacular set of special events, capsules and rewards!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Enjoy 8th Anniversary Celebration events from September 12th (11:00am) through October 10th, 2022 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Take a chance at the Wildcat Slots and get BIG Cat Food rewards!'''}}<br>
One more chance to get all 7s and earn a jackpot of Cat Food!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from September 26th (12:00am) until October 10th, 2022 (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Tap the Wildcat Slots tab at the top of the Cat Base menu during this event to see if how lucky you'll get! Prizes of at least 777 Cat Food as a special service, only during this event!<br>
Don't miss out!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 4 different special Anniversary Sale Packs to buy!'''}}<br>
Stock up on Cat Food and other awesome items with these spectacular sales!<br>
The "Thank-You Pack" and the Silver, Gold and Platinum "Limited Sale" packs are available for a short time only {{Color|#FF00FF|'''between September 26th (12:00am) and October 10th (10:59am)'''}}<br>
Get tons of Cat Food, Rare Tickets, and more during these limited sale events!<br>
These super deals will only be around for a short time, so don't miss out!

※ Thank-You/Limited Sale Packs can only be purchased once per user account during the sale period.<br>
※ If the Thank-You/Limited Sale Packs fail to appear as scheduled, update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Super Limited Unit: "Gacha Cat" ON SALE!'''}}<br>
Between {{Color|#FF00FF|'''September 12th (11am) and October 10th (11am),'''}} limited unit [[Gacha Cat (Special Cat)|Gacha Cat]] is available for direct purchase in a super value pack including Cat Food and XP!

※ The Gacha Cat Set can only be purchased once per user account during the sale period.<br>
※ If the Gacha Cat Sale fails to appear as scheduled, update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Platinum Ticket Sale!'''}}<br>
Only during this event, buy a Platinum Ticket to boost your army!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available September 12 (11:00am) through October 10 (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Get a guaranteed Uber Rare Cat with every Platinum Ticket you use at the Ubers Only Platinum Capsules! Don't miss this chance to get top-class heroes!

※ One Platinum Ticket per user account can be bought during this event.<br>
※ If the Platinum Ticket offer does not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.<br>
※ Certain units from Seasonal Rare Capsules, Collab Capsules, and Girls & Monsters sets cannot be collected from Platinum Capsule draws.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●First Time Draw Discount Restart!'''}}<br>
All players get a half-off discount on the Cat Food cost of their first Rare Capsule draw following this 8th Anniversary reset! Your first {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Single Draw'''}} (normally 150 Cat Food) will cost only {{Color|#FF00FF|'''30 Cat Food!'''}}<br>
And your first {{Color|#FF00FF|'''11-Capsule Draw'''}} (normally 1500 Cat Food) will cost you only {{Color|#FF00FF|'''750 Cat Food!'''}}<br>

※ If the First Time discount fails to appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.<br>
※Please be aware that received characters are randomly chosen; Uber Rares are not guaranteed during this event.<br>
※One single draw and one 11-draw may be made at the discounted Cat Food cost above. Cat Food costs will return to normal following these draws.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Collect a Platinum Ticket to celebrate 8 Years of Battle Cats fun!'''}}<br>
Complete a special anniversary mission to clear {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Empire of Cats Ch. 1'''}}, then head to the Catnip Challenges Special Missions section to claim your prize of one {{Color|#FF0000|'''Platinum Ticket'''}},, that can be exchanged for a draw of one guaranteed Uber Rare hero at the Rare Capsule machine!<br>
Take on other anniversary event-only Special Missions as well for extra rewards!

※ After completing the mission, you must claim your prize at the Catnip Challenges before October 10th, 2022 (11:59pm). If you do not claim your prize before then, you will not be able to earn the reward.<br>
※ Even players {{Color|#008000|'''who have already cleared Empire of Cats Ch. 1 can collect this reward!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 8th Anniversary Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Challenge the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Birthday Present!'''}} map to earn a {{Color|#FF0000|'''20 Cat Food'''}} reward on your first clear each day.<br>
The stage rewards will {{Color|#008000|'''reset once each day at 12:00am'''}}, so clear it again and again until the end of the event to pick up a daily Cat Food prize!<br>
If you clear the stage each and every day of this event, you can pick up a {{Color|#FF0000|'''max total of 580 Cat Food!'''}} If you include daily login stamp rewards, you can get a {{Color|#FF0000|'''total of 830 bonus Cat Food'''}} from this anniversary campaign!
Plus, don't miss out on the Birthday Present mission in the Catnip Challenges!

※ 8th Anniversary mission rewards can only be collected until the end of this campaign on October 10th (11:59pm). If the collect button is not pressed for a completed mission before this deadline, the rewards will become unavailable.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● "Monthly All-Stars Grateful Gathering" Special Map!'''}}<br>
Tough Monthly map enemies crowded into one big, big challenge!<br>
Clear the stage for a chance to earn rewards of up to 30,000,000 XP!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available September 12 (11:00am) through October 10 (10:59am)!'''}}

※ After clearing a Gauntlet Map stage a certain number of times, you must wait for a short time before challenging the stage again.<br>
※ Spend a Catamin A during the cooldown period to skip the waiting time and challenge the stage immediately.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 8th Anniversary Event All Stars map: Super Present DX!'''}}<br>
A limited addition to the Event All Stars series of special maps, available only for a limited time! Collect awesome item rewards on stage clear!<br>
Seasonal enemies stand in your way! Can you fight them off? Earn victory to pick up {{Color|#FF0000|'''super useful battle items!'''}}<br>
From September 26, 2022 (12:00am) until October 10, 2022 (10:59am), challenge this map at the times below:<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''6:00am~8:59am / 12:00pm~2:59pm / 7:00pm~10:59pm'''}}<br>
Plus, earn {{Color|#0563C1|'''30 Cat Food'''}} each time you clear an All-Stars stage for the first time!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Super tough Limited Invasion Stages appear for one big event!'''}}<br>
Can you topple the biggest bosses of the Special Stages?<br>
Check the schedule below to take on one Limited Invasion stages after another!

'''Invasion Event Phase 1''': {{Color|#FF00FF|'''September 12 (11:00am) - September 25, 2022 (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
The stages below will appear:<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Clionel Ascendant"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "River Styx"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "King Wahwah's Revenge"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Deeply Dreaming"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The Angel & The Demon"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The King & The Maiden"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The King & The Angel"

'''Invasion Event Phase 2''': {{Color|#FF00FF|'''September 26 (12:00am) - October 10, 2022 (10:59am)'''}}<br>
The stages below will appear:<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Queen's Coronation"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Dead on Debut"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Blue Impact"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The Queen & The Dead"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The Dead & The Bloated"<br>
・Continuation Stage: "The Queen & The Maiden"

Can you withstand the gauntlet of giants?! Clear the stages and earn limited Cat Unit rewards!<br>
Plus, get extra rewards by clearing Special Missions, including additional missions that appear as you complete challenges! You can earn mission rewards like Catseyes and Rare Tickets even if you've previously cleared mission stages, so check the Catnip Challenges!

※ As Limited Invasion missions are cleared during this event period, other linked missions will appear with additional rewards available.<br>
※ Invasion Phase 1 Mission Rewards must be claimed at the Catnip Challenges before this event ends on September 25th, 2022 (11:59pm). Invasion Phase 2 Mission Rewards must be claimed at the Catnip Challenges before this event ends on October 10th, 2022 (10:59am).<br>
※ Catseyes will be available to use after reaching User Rank 1600.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Are you ready to take on any enemy trait? Heavenly Tower Citadel stages are here!'''}}<br>
Stretching to the sky, a tower shrouded in mystery appears to challenge your Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from September 12th (11:00am) until October 10th, 2022 (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
I sense...yes! Every 3 days a new tower will appear!<br>
I wonder what's at the top! Test your might and find out!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Cybear's Vengeance Returns for the 8th Anniversary!'''}}<br>
Your chance to collect a pile of Cat Tickets! The Deadly challenge "Cybear's Vengeance" is here for a limited time!<br>
Clear the stage when it appears at the time below and you'll pick up a stack of {{Color|#FF0000|'''5 Cat Tickets!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''September 12th (11:00am) thru September 18th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''September 19th (12:00am) thru September 25th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''September 26th (12:00am) thru October 2nd (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''October 3rd (12:00am) thru October 10th (10:59am)'''}}

{{Color|#008000|'''The stage can be cleared and rewards collected once during each event period!'''}}<br>
Plus, the very first time you clear this stage, you will collect a bonus reward of {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''30 Cat Food!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catclaw Dojo Challenges'''}}<br>
Get your strongest soldiers of the Cat Army ready, the Dojo Ranking Event is here throughout the 8th Anniversary Campaign and it's time to prove yourself!<br>
Head to the Catclaw Dojo from the Battle Cats Title Menu and enter the Arena of Honor to join in the challenge! Climb to the highest tiers of power as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players? Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn a special prize when your final high score determines your skill tier on October 10th! Tap the Rewards List button to see what you might win as you climb the rankings!<br>
Plus, collect bonus rewards for completing the dojo mission at the Catnip Challenges!

※ 8th Anniversary dojo mission rewards can only be collected until the end of this campaign on October 10th (11:59pm). If the collect button is not pressed for a completed mission before this deadline, the rewards will become unavailable.<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. It may take a short while after the end of this event before your rewards are delivered. Thank you for your patience!<br>
※ Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Dojo event scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If Dojo events do not appear even if the conditions are met, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limied Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Take on the limited edition stage {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Minced Meet-Up'''}}, and collect the limited unit [[Catburger (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Catburger'''}}]]!<br>
Then visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event to take on the limited awakening stage {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Catburger Awakens!"'''}} for a chance to claim the power of {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catburger's third form'''}}!

※ Upgrade Catburger to level 20 to reveal the Evolve option in the Upgrade screen!<br>
※ If you have not collected Catburger, you can still collect its third form as a drop reward and use it once you meet the Evolve conditions.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Half-Off Energy Cost for Empire, Future and Cosmos stages!'''}}<br>
During this event, the Cat Energy cost to challenge stages in the {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, {{Color|#008000|'''Into the Future'''}}, or {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} will be half the normal cost each day during the times below!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am ~ 8:59am / 12:00pm ~ 1:59pm / 7:00pm ~ 8:59pm'''}}

※ This Cat Energy cost reduction does not apply to Zombie Outbreak stages.<br>
※ If the Cat Energy reduction does not appear at the listed times above, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 50% Off Cat Food Discount on Special Cats'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|Treasure Festival}}, all day every day!<br>
On even days visit {{Color|#FF00FF|Empire of Cats}}, and on {{Color|#1ECCFF|odd days}} head to {{Color|#1ECCFF|Into the Future}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|Cats of the Cosmos}} on {{Color|#0000FF|9/14, 9/17, 9/20, 9/23, 9/26, 9/29, 10/2, 10/5, 10/8!}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas Cats Eye Cave and XP Harvest  for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
・'''XP Harvest (3 areas)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''September 26th (12:00am) thru October 2nd (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
・'''Cats Eye Cave'''<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''October 3rd (12:00am) thru October 10th (10:59am)'''}}<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catseye Item Capsules'''}}<br>
'''September 26th (12:00am) thru October 2nd (11:59pm)'''<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catfruit Item Capsules'''}}<br>
'''October 3rd (12:00am) thru October 10th (10:59am)'''

※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Daily 8th Anniversary Celebration Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app each day to collect a new login stamp and unlock awesome rewards of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cat Food, Rare Tickets'''}} and more during this anniversary campaign!<br>
Don't miss a day to pick up the maximum total rewards of {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''250 Cat Food'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''5 Rare Tickets'''}}! Plus, collect limited Special unit [[Coin Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#0000FF|'''Coin Cat'''}}]] with your {{Color|#0000FF|'''6th stamp'''}}!<br>

※ After collecting Farmer Cat and Coin Cat, activate them at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.

